  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Cook sweet potato noodles over medium-high heat, stirring occasionally with a fork to separate, until tender, 4-6 minutes.\n• Drain, rinse and drizzle with olive oil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cbdd3cd318353e2a9c03/step-f5fa0000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice carrot into half-moons.\n• Roughly chop Asian greens.\n• Thinly slice flat mushrooms (see ingredients) and long chilli (if using).\n• Finely chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cbdd3cd318353e2a9c03/step-930bf010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Using your hands, crumble firm tofu (see ingredients) into small chunks.\n• In a medium bowl, combine tofu, Asian BBQ seasoning and a drizzle of olive oil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cbdd3cd318353e2a9c03/step-59db6720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Add tofu and cook, tossing, until golden, 4-5 minutes.\n• Remove pan from heat, then stir in half the soy sauce mix and a splash of water until well coated.\n• Transfer to a bowl and cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cbdd3cd318353e2a9c03/step-9e8e0130.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Wipe out frying pan, then return to high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook mushrooms until just softened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add carrot and cook until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium, then add Asian greens and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add cooked noodles, hoisin sauce, remaining soy sauce mix, the vinegar and a good splash of water.\n• Toss to combine and season to taste with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cbdd3cd318353e2a9c03/step-a025f540.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide glass noodles between bowls.\n• Top with Chinese BBQ crumbled tofu.\n• Sprinkle with chilli to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cbdd3cd318353e2a9c03/step-c24e1350.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
